meta {
  name: 05 ITI-105 Publish
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  IHE MHD ITI-105 Simplified Publish, run in order. 1 publishes a small patient summary whose Patient carries a fixed identifier (publishPatientSystem|publishPatientValue), so repeat runs reuse one server Patient. 2-6 read, find, retrieve byte-for-byte and check validation status. 7-8 publish/retrieve non-FHIR content. 9-10 are negative tests.
}
